      "docstring": "Compute the final L5 enforcement decision:\n\n    INPUTS:\n        \u2022 SafetyResult  (LLM-based detection)\n        \u2022 CouncilVote   (heuristic QA-derived)\n        \u2022 SafetyPolicy  (Phase-3 policy registry)\n        \u2022 ctx           (ExecutionContext for telemetry)\n\n    OUTPUT:\n        \u2022 PolicyDecisionEvent",
